Z||000000||lildevil||12-11-2001||10:30 PM||||Jus to let you guys know...the issue of High Performance Pontiac magazine with my car in it should be on newsstands this weekend. I jus got mine  in the mail.  My car is on the cover but its a small pic so you'll have to look for it. It has a large pic of a red 69 Firebird doing a burnout.  Overall i am happy with the article and the respond the author gave the car.   If youget  a chance to read the magazine think about writing in to the editor about the article.  If theres a huge responds they would be stupid not to put more Fiero stuff in there.<P> <P>------------------<BR>Earl Sessions<BR>1985 Fiero w/ 1998 Supercharged 3.8 V-6<BR>Best ET: 13.232 @ 101.24 mph<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/water3quarterthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||6
